/-! # Source (paper): Trocq: Proof Transfer for Free, With or Without Univalence

Cohen, Crance, and Mahboubi's proof-transfer framework factors equivalence into a bidirectional
six-level hierarchy of structures on heterogeneous relations, then uses annotated parametricity to
infer the least relational structure required by a transfer. -/

